First take ddl of schema:

db2look -d BIPDB -z DEV_BIP -e -o DEV_BIP.sql
Note change name in sql file for schema name and save.

now execute the sql file:

db2 -tvf DEV_BIP.sql

If you want to move data then :

use this:
db2move BIPDB EXPORT -sn DEV_BIP

after that:
import data : db2move BIPDB LOAD (in same schema you can run directe but if you load in diffrent schema the you will change in db2move.list file with schema name)

then run :
db2move BIPDB LOAD

====================================================================================================================================================================================================================================================================
after load you check table then show this error:

SQL0668N Operation not allowed for reason code "1"
on table "DEV_BIP_T.CSS_ROLE_LOCALES"
SQLSTATE=57016

After that table in going "SQL0668N reason code "1" ka matlab hota hai ki table SET INTEGRITY pending state"

now fix it:

Check table status:

SELECT TABSCHEMA,
       TABNAME,
       STATUS
FROM SYSCAT.TABLES
WHERE TABSCHEMA='DEV_BIP_T'
  AND TABNAME='CSS_ROLE_LOCALES';


Fix:
SET INTEGRITY FOR DEV_BIP_T.CSS_ROLE_LOCALES IMMEDIATE CHECKED;

if many table in pending state:
SELECT 'SET INTEGRITY FOR '
       || RTRIM(TABSCHEMA) || '.'
       || RTRIM(TABNAME)
       || ' IMMEDIATE CHECKED;'
FROM SYSCAT.TABLES
WHERE STATUS='C';

Load ke baad common fix:
Agar aapne db2move LOAD use kiya hai, to load complete hone ke baad aksar ye chalana padta hai:

SET INTEGRITY FOR ALL IMMEDIATE CHECKED;









